@startuml uc14_byo_key_cost
title UC-14 — Bring your own AI key and watch the cost (FR-31, FR-30)

skinparam shadowing false
autonumber
actor "Recruiter /\nAdmin" as User
participant LlmController as LC
participant "ApiKeyStore\n(secret-cipher)" as Keys
participant UserRepository as Users
participant UsageController as UC
participant UsageMeter as Meter

== Store a key + pick a provider ==
User -> LC : PUT /settings/providers/:id/key { key }
activate LC
LC -> Keys : encrypt (AES-256-GCM) + store per user
LC -> Users : persist llmProvider choice (ADR-0011)
LC --> User : saved (key never returned)
deactivate LC

== Every AI call is metered ==
note over Meter : each feature run records requests/tokens/cost\n(LlmFeatureRunner.meter — never blocks the feature)

== See the spend ==
User -> UC : GET /settings/usage
activate UC
UC -> Meter : list(user)
Meter --> UC : per-provider / per-feature totals
UC --> User : requests · tokens · rough $ (+ CSV audit trail)
deactivate UC
@enduml
